      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.60 (up from ₹7.55 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.40b (up 14% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹344.1m (up 1.1% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 25% (down from 28% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 4.9%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 6.4%. Revenue is forecast to grow 21% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 2.8% growth forecast for the Banks industry in India.",
